§ `ss 24A, 24B`

#ASSERT `the negligence claim is in time` `a car-crash injury sued after 2 years`
#ASSERT NOT `the negligence claim is in time` `a car-crash injury sued after 4 years`
#ASSERT `the negligence claim is in time` `an asbestos disease discovered 2 years ago, 12 years after exposure`
#ASSERT `the negligence claim is in time` `a building defect found 2 years ago, 10 years after construction`
#ASSERT `the negligence claim is in time` `a building defect found 7 years after construction, sued at year 8`
#ASSERT NOT `the negligence claim is in time` `a building defect found last year, 16 years after construction`

§ `s 24`

#ASSERT `the disability extension saves the claim` `a child injured, suing 2 years after reaching majority`
#ASSERT NOT `the disability extension saves the claim` `the same suing 4 years after`
#ASSERT `the disability extension saves the claim` `a child owed a contract debt, suing 5 years after`
#ASSERT NOT `the disability extension saves the claim` `an adult claimant`

§ `ss 26 to 28`

